  "content": {
    "title": "关于召开党史学习教育组织生活会的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2021-08-03",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">各位党员：</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;为全面贯彻落实习近平总书记关于党史学习教育重讲话和重要指示批示精神，根据中心党总支关于召开党史学习教育专题组织生活会的通知，结合流动党员支部实际，现就召开党史学习教育组织生活会有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一、组织生活会主题</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;增强党性意识，坚定理想信念，全面深化学习党的百年奋斗史。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、方法步骤</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; （一）认真组织学习</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;召开组织生活会前，各位党员要认真学习研读《习近平论中国共产党历史》《中国共产党简史》《习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想学习问答》等指定学习书籍，跟进学习习近平总书记在庆贺中国共产党成立100周年大会上的重要讲话精神，认真学习党章准则条例等党内重要法规。通过学习，加深对习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的领悟，深化牢记中国共产党百年奋斗光辉历程，自觉把思想和行动统一到党央的决策部署上来，为开好专题组织生活会打牢思想基础。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (二）认真检视问题</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 紧扣党史学习教育专题，支委成员要全面盘点参与学习</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">的收获感悟，坚持学史明理、学史增信、学史崇德、学史力行，从中查找差距检视问题。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;（三）撰写对照检查材料。</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;党员要认真撰写个人检视剖析材料，做到三个讲清：一是讲清楚梳理检视的问题；二是讲清楚存在问题的原因；三是讲清楚努力方向和整改措施。</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;三、召开时间</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2021年8月11日</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;四、相关要求</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 受疫情影响，各位党员自行安排学习交流方式，可就近在工作地、居住地党组织参加组织生活会，个人检视剖析材料需在8月9日前上交。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-right:43px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-right:43px; text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-right:43px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心流动党员支部</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-right:43px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">2021年8月3日</span></span></p>\n\n                ",
